---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Fees & Funding · Blackfen Little Learners"
  description="Information about the voluntary £7 daily meals and consumables charge, optional deposits, and alternatives for families who opt out."
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="container-prose">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Fees & funding</p>
      <h1 class="text-balance">Meals and consumables.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-ink-700/85">
        We offer an optional charge of <strong>£7 per day</strong> to help cover
        your child's meals, nappies, wipes, nappy cream and toddler groups.
        This charge is voluntary.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-5 text-ink-700/85">
        A deposit may also be requested in some cases to secure a place. If a
        deposit applies, the amount and terms will be agreed with you in advance.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 card-tinted">
        <h2 class="text-2xl">If you choose not to pay</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink-700/85">
          You can opt out of the charge. Please provide your child's meals,
          nappies, wipes and nappy cream for each day they attend.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-ink-700/85">
        Choosing not to pay for these extras does not affect access to a funded
        early years place. For more information about funded childcare and
        alternatives to optional extras, see the
        <a href="https://www.gov.uk/free-childcare-if-working/what-youll-get" class="text-lilac-700 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GOV.UK guidance for parents</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
